  "body": "Demo PR, not to be merged. Sets `offsite_lock_mode: none`: the bucket is created without Object Lock and backups are shipped without retention. Expected: with the stolen backup key the ransomware deletes the off-site backups, nothing can be restored, and the `drill` job fails; the ruleset blocks the merge. `unit` is expected to fail too (`test_repository_policy_loads` pins COMPLIANCE).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
